  "harmonic_cutoff": "Over every Q-algebra,DeltaP=Gamma(P,P)=0 and origin order>=r>=1 imply all pure moments zero and E(QP^m)=0 forrm>deg Q. Over C for nonzero P the real coefficient1/r is sharp by the first nonzero homogeneous part and exact source coefficient extraction.",
  "translated_gate": "Coefficients of HP-P and HP^2-P^2 generate the literal ordinary coefficient ideal(DeltaP,Gamma(P,P)),equal to the full all-m translated heat-fixing or centered-translate pure ideal;this is NOT an ordinary origin-only pure prefix2.",
